# CellChat panels -- needs 05_cellchat/* (cellchat_figure_data.rds)
#   Figure 3A  CD4 x PD-1 dot plot        Supp Fig 4A-B  CD4 x PD-1 benchmarks/controls
#   Figure 4C  CD8 x PD-1 dot plot        Supp Fig 4C-D  CD8 x PD-1 benchmarks/controls
#   Figure 5A  CD8 x TIGIT dot plot       Supp Fig 4E-F  CD8 x TIGIT benchmarks/controls
